sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor L as 👤 Learner
    participant App as 📱 FirstTap App
    participant STT as /api/stt
    participant TTS as /api/tts
    participant Sim as 📱 Simulator Screen
    participant LLM as /api/llm-doubt

    App->>TTS: "Watch Selvi tap the Search button"
    TTS-->>App: 🔊 audio (Tamil/Hindi/English)
    App->>L: Play narration + animate cursor on screen
    App->>Sim: Show DEMO step (glowing cursor taps target)

    Note over L,Sim: Learner watches the demo
    App->>TTS: "Now your turn! Tap the glowing button"
    TTS-->>App: 🔊 audio
    App->>L: Play practice prompt

    L->>Sim: Taps correct element ✅
    Sim-->>App: Practice step success
    App->>TTS: "Excellent! You did it!"
    TTS-->>App: 🔊 audio
    App->>L: Celebration sound + next step begins

    alt Learner asks a doubt
        L->>App: 🎤 "I don't understand UPI"
        App->>STT: audio blob
        STT-->>App: transcript text
        App->>LLM: question + lesson context
        LLM-->>App: safe, guardrailed answer
        App->>TTS: answer text
        TTS-->>App: 🔊 audio answer
        App->>L: Answer played → lesson resumes
    end

    alt Learner taps wrong 3 times
        App->>App: Auto-restart DEMO for this step
        App->>L: Replay narration + cursor animation
    end
